1
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:11,040
I'm not going to deny
my own feelings anymore.

2
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,880
PREVIOUSLY

3
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,920
I'll protect you.

4
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,520
Pong…

5
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:17,400
He threatened to kill me.

6
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,920
So I poisoned him.

7
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,200
I was Raiwin's first wife.

8
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:24,200
It isn't true. Say something.

9
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:27,040
Why didn't you ever tell me?

10
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,840
Chayanee.

11
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,080
I'm sorry.

12
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,120
I didn't want to tell you

13
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:42,520
because it was a terrible part of my past.
The worst part of my life.

14
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,600
And you think it's been good for my life?

15
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:58,880
I told you, didn't I?

16
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,760
Never make me suffer.

17
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,200
Never make me cry.

18
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,160
I gave you everything.

19
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,920
Do you have any idea how much
money I spent helping you?

20
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,040
I'm sorry.

21
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,320
Please…

22
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,640
put the gun down.

23
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,600
I got pregnant

24
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,720
because I wanted us to have a family.

25
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,040
And you ruined everything.

26
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:52,360
Now Nuchwara has made a fool out of me.

27
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,960
Chayanee.

28
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,720
Don't think like that.

29
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,440
I love you,

30
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,920
and I love our baby.

31
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:13,920
We can start over.
We'll register our marriage

32
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,720
and become legally married.

33
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,840
You love me?

34
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,600
You're the only woman I love.

35
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,920
Would you die for me?

36
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,120
You don't have to die for me.

37
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:49,400
But if you really love me,

38
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,120
you have to do something for me.

39
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:02,640
Nuchwara humiliated me and made me suffer.

40
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:06,680
It feels like she slapped me
in front of everyone.

41
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,000
I don't want to see her again.

42
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,000
Fine.

43
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,480
I'll throw Nuchwara out.

44
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,720
She'll never set foot here again.

45
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,040
Kill her.

46
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,960
If you can't do it,

47
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,880
don't ever show your face here again.

48
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:47,120
And I'll expose your vote buying
and election fraud.

49
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,240
Go ahead.

50
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,200
You choose.

51
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,600
Are you going to save her life…

52
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,840
or save your own?

53
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,760
What are they talking about?

54
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:18,920
Saksit is being investigated over
the garbage-truck procurement project.

55
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,440
And several other projects show

56
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,560
signs of corruption too.

57
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:24,600
The old streetlight case

58
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,200
still hasn't been cleared up.
Now there are more cases?

59
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,240
Everyone must face
the consequences of their actions.

60
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,880
Boss.

61
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,440
Someone's here to see you.

62
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,280
Open it! Open it up!

63
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,680
Well? Do you like it?

64
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:51,760
Now that you've got your food.
Please enjoy.

65
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:54,320
I brought you a video of Raiwin
and his father buying votes.

66
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,960
Why did you change your mind
and turn on him?

67
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,960
I remember

68
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,600
you saying you hated corrupt politicians.

69
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,480
But you still took their money.

70
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,080
You were right.

71
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,800
We kept voting for whoever paid us.

72
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:11,440
Then once they got into office.
They never did

73
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,600
anything for the people.

74
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,960
I've had enough of crooked politicians

75
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,520
living off our tax money.

76
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,320
What do you want me to do?

77
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:21,360
Help file a complaint
about the election fraud.

78
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,440
The villagers and I will testify.

79
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,640
But…

80
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,920
you could be prosecuted too

81
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:27,960
for selling your votes.

82
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,720
So be it.

83
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:32,080
I don't want them passing
their corrupt power down.

84
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,400
I'll send you every video
I have of them buying votes.

85
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,600
Dad.

86
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:45,560
Have you heard? Someone filed a complaint
against me for buying votes.

87
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,640
You too?

88
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,840
I'm already being investigated
over my old projects.

89
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,760
Who has the nerve
to come after us like this?

90
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:56,640
I've already spent a fortune
paying off reporters

91
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,080
and silencing complainants.

92
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,240
So what do we do now?

93
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,640
You find more money.

94
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:06,320
Otherwise, everything
we've done will collapse.

95
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,360
Go ask your wife for money.

96
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,720
Then use whatever she gives you

97
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:14,120
to silence the reporters
and the committee investigating us.

98
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:16,520
Nuchwara already exposed everything, Dad.

99
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:20,080
Chayanee knows Papang is my son now.

100
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,440
She's furious.

101
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,320
She won't help me anymore.

102
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,600
Damn it!

103
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,000
You find that money somehow.

104
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:29,680
If you can't, you and I

105
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,280
are both

106
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,480
going to prison.

107
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:35,200
Get up. Go!

108
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,640
And don't come back
until you find the money.

109
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,880
Remember, I am not going to prison.

110
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,560
Damn it!

111
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,360
Is there anything I can do to help?

112
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:47,680
You? What could you possibly do for me?

113
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:50,960
Don't forget.
Ramil inherited a lot of money.

114
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,440
He has enough to help you.

115
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:56,120
You think your son Ramil would help me?

116
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,600
If I ask him,

117
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,880
he won't refuse me.

118
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,600
What do you want?

119
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,960
Why are you suddenly being nice

120
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:08,640
and offering to help?

121
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:14,600
You know

122
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:17,960
how grateful I am for
everything you've done for me.

123
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,680
You used to call

124
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:23,640
my son and me parasites.

125
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,560
Let me finally repay you.

126
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:37,280
I need 20 million.

127
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:40,160
Can you get it for me?

128
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:50,200
MAE THONG TEM - THAI TRADITIONAL DESERT

129
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:55,240
This looks great.

130
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,720
These are all my favorites.

131
00:10:56,800 --> 00:11:00,040
Who would know what you like
better than someone who loves you?

132
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,960
Well…

133
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,800
your mother really wanted to see you.

134
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,760
It must be something important.

135
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:29,480
I…

136
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:34,440
I'm only asking you to have
one meal with her. Just this once.

137
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,720
After this, I won't put you
in an uncomfortable position again.

138
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,000
Please.

139
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,720
Aunt Sanguansri, please sit.

140
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,240
The food here is good.

141
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:04,000
But I think you'd like my cooking better.

142
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,040
Just tell me what you want.

143
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,800
So I can get back to work.

144
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,400
I want to

145
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,240
ask you for some money.

146
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,480
What for?

147
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,520
Don't tell me

148
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,920
you're going to pull strings to help them.

149
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,360
Yes.

150
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:34,080
Mom. Have you lived with them so long
that you've become just like them?

151
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:36,680
You know I hate corrupt people.

152
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,240
And I'll make sure they pay for this.

153
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,400
I have to do this.

154
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,560
Please.

155
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:52,200
Think of this money as buying my freedom.

156
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,880
And after this,
I'll never bother you again. Please.

157
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,600
I know you meant well.

158
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:19,200
You wanted my mom
and me to work things out.

159
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,280
But it was a waste of time.

160
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:24,200
Mom will do anything for that…

161
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,120
terrible man.

162
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:33,640
Are you going to help her?

163
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,720
I…

164
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:43,680
I'm not going to interfere
with your decision.

165
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:47,520
But I know your mother has a reason.

166
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,800
And I think it's a good one.

167
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:57,880
She's my mom…

168
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:01,600
and even I barely trust her.

169
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,360
Why are you defending her so strongly?

170
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:09,920
Why are you so sure?

171
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,000
Huh?

172
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:15,920
Well… I'm a woman too.

173
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,200
I can tell.

174
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,560
Your mother

175
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,880
loves you very much.

176
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:30,320
Nuch, what do you want?

177
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,600
What are you talking about?

178
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,560
You filed a complaint

179
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,560
about me buying votes.

180
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:40,320
Did you actually buy votes?

181
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,600
If you won that position honestly,

182
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,720
then you have nothing to be afraid of.

183
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,840
Don't play games with me.

184
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:51,840
I know you're trying to get revenge

185
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,960
by having me removed as Subdistrict Chief.

186
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:55,080
Yes.

187
00:14:56,840 --> 00:15:00,280
I'm going to make you pay
for what you did to me and my son.

188
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:03,040
You're nothing but a political parasite.

189
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:06,720
I want my son to grow up
in a decent society.

190
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,280
Not one filled with
corrupt people like you.

191
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,960
Don't challenge me.

192
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:17,040
Does it hurt? You must be furious.
You must hate me.

193
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,320
Now you know what it feels like

194
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:23,520
to be betrayed.

195
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,120
I only filed the complaint.

196
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,720
I haven't submitted the evidence yet.

197
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:32,920
If you don't want things to get worse,

198
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:35,120
resign before they force you.

199
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:39,160
I won't let anyone destroy my life.

200
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,280
If you don't want to die,

201
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,360
withdraw the complaint.

202
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:47,000
Go ahead. I have nothing left to lose.

203
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,520
Do whatever you want.

204
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:52,400
You're nothing but a coward

205
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:56,800
who hides in his father's shadow.

206
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,040
You live off women

207
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,680
and hide behind their skirts.

208
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:03,040
Shut up!

209
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:06,120
I have to be Chief.
I have to become a minister.

210
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,360
Mommy! Let Mommy go!

211
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,440
Nuch.

212
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:16,840
Are you okay?

213
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,120
Please…

214
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,520
help me.

215
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:36,760
Please help me.

216
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:42,680
I have no one else.

217
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:46,320
You're the only person who can help me.

218
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,680
I need money.

219
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:53,880
I need money to make these cases go away.

220
00:16:55,640 --> 00:16:57,160
Your father created these problems.

221
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,720
So did you.

222
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:03,640
Why should I get dragged into them?

223
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:08,119
No one else can help me.

224
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:11,920
I need to keep my position
as Subdistrict Chief.

225
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,440
Next term,

226
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:16,000
I'll run for Parliament.

227
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,720
And I'll make you a minister's wife.

228
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:22,119
I promise.

229
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,600
I'm done dreaming that big.

230
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,880
There's only one little thing

231
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:35,840
I want from you first.

232
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,240
Kill Nuchwara.

233
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:46,120
Hey…

234
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:50,120
Please ask me to do something else.

235
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:53,240
I can't kill someone.

236
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:01,840
Or are you going to wait
until she destroys you first?

237
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,560
If you let her live,

238
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:12,120
one day she'll destroy your life.

239
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:20,080
Even if you become prime minister,

240
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:25,000
she'll keep coming after you.

241
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:38,360
I'll stay by your side.

242
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:44,400
I'll help you with everything.

243
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:02,800
You're back.

244
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:05,120
Come here.

245
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,800
Well?

246
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:10,760
The money.

247
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:12,840
Did he transfer it?

248
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,880
He hasn't given me an answer yet.

249
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,160
What do you mean?

250
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:21,200
You told me if you spoke to him,
he'd help you.

251
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:22,760
I warned you

252
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,760
he had no intention of helping me.

253
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,520
Get out.

254
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:30,840
Go live with that
arrogant son of yours. Go!

255
00:19:35,760 --> 00:19:36,760
It's Ramil.

256
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:39,680
Then answer it. Talk to him.

257
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:42,800
Hello.

258
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,000
I'll give you the money.

259
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:46,960
But this is the last time I'm helping.

260
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:50,560
Thank you, Ramil.

261
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,640
Yes.

262
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:55,480
Hey.

263
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:57,360
What did he say?

264
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,480
Ramil agreed.

265
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:03,240
I'll give you the money
so you can fight the cases.

266
00:20:03,320 --> 00:20:04,880
Wow.

267
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:08,440
Thank you so much.

268
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,760
You're sacrificing yourself for me.

269
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:12,840
And…

270
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:15,200
I'm sorry

271
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:18,400
if I've spoken badly to you.
I've just been stressed.

272
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:21,200
Sanguansri.

273
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:23,240
I'll take you out tonight.

274
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:26,440
We can get something to eat.
What would you like?

275
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:30,240
We don't need to go out. Let's eat here.

276
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:34,360
I feel like having a drink too.
And I want to talk to you privately.

277
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:36,560
Of course, sweetheart.

278
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:39,440
I'll have them prepare

279
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,160
your favorite food and drinks.

280
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:51,080
It's done.

281
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:54,520
I'm glad you agreed to help your mother.

282
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:56,960
I'm choosing to trust you.

283
00:20:57,040 --> 00:21:00,400
I believe you must have a good reason
for wanting me to help her.

284
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:03,280
I want everything to go back
to the way it was.

285
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:04,840
I want you to be happy again.

286
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:23,520
Have another drink.

287
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:25,480
You keep filling my glass.

288
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:27,640
I want to celebrate for you.

289
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:29,280
The money from Ramil

290
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:31,640
will help make the cases go away.

291
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:34,680
And Raiwin's projects can continue too.

292
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:38,080
You really do

293
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:40,760
know me well.

294
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:44,200
That's why I never brought another woman

295
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,760
into this house to replace you.

296
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:53,000
Thank you for respecting me as your wife.

297
00:21:54,320 --> 00:21:55,960
But there is something

298
00:21:56,040 --> 00:21:58,520
troubling me that I want to ask.

299
00:21:58,600 --> 00:22:00,160
Ask me anything.

300
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,200
There are no secrets between us.

301
00:22:02,840 --> 00:22:05,640
When Anon died,

302
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:07,600
a lot of people thought

303
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:09,760
you might have been involved.

304
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:15,040
I'm just wondering.

305
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:18,160
The day you arranged to meet Anon,

306
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:20,240
did you actually see him?

307
00:22:30,320 --> 00:22:31,560
Well?

308
00:22:32,760 --> 00:22:33,640
Oh.

309
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,920
It's exactly what I told you before.

310
00:22:39,560 --> 00:22:42,520
I waited at the lawyer's house.
Anon never came.

311
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:44,720
Then I heard

312
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:47,160
that he'd been shot and killed.

313
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:50,280
Thinking about it now,

314
00:22:50,360 --> 00:22:52,400
I really do feel terrible.

315
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:55,680
We probably should have arranged
to meet him here instead.

316
00:22:56,840 --> 00:22:58,720
By the way,

317
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:03,240
where are you meeting your son?

318
00:23:03,320 --> 00:23:04,960
I'll drive you.

319
00:23:05,040 --> 00:23:07,160
Just send me the location.

320
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:10,400
All right.

321
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:26,920
Where are you going?

322
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:31,560
You don't need to worry about me.

323
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:34,920
Spend your time fixing your own problems.

324
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:37,960
I'll drive you.

325
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,760
What made you want to drive me?

326
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:45,280
I want to make sure
you're really leaving my life.

327
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:51,600
Don't worry.

328
00:23:52,320 --> 00:23:54,120
I don't want to see your face either.

329
00:23:55,280 --> 00:23:56,560
Although before long,

330
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:59,160
I might come visit you in prison.

331
00:24:04,560 --> 00:24:06,280
Do you want me to come with you?

332
00:24:07,080 --> 00:24:08,640
It's okay.

333
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:11,720
I'm just taking the money to Mom.
I'll be right back.

334
00:24:12,320 --> 00:24:13,160
Okay.

335
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:15,400
Daddy.

336
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:16,600
Oh?

337
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:18,440
Where's Mommy?

338
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:23,680
Mommy went home.

339
00:24:23,760 --> 00:24:25,120
She just has some work to do.

340
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:27,240
Stay with Daddy for now, okay?

341
00:24:27,320 --> 00:24:29,560
I had a nightmare.

342
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:33,400
I dreamed a giant monster took Mommy away.

343
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:36,880
I miss her.

344
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:37,920
Oh…

345
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:41,480
Daddy, please take me to see Mommy.

346
00:24:42,320 --> 00:24:44,680
-Please.
-Calm down, Papang.

347
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:50,400
Don't cry, sweetheart. It's okay.

348
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:57,640
Let Daddy take care of his errand first.
I'll take you to Mommy myself.

349
00:24:57,720 --> 00:25:01,040
-Come on. No more crying.
-I'll send you the location.

350
00:25:01,120 --> 00:25:02,520
-Okay.
-Take care of him.

351
00:25:02,600 --> 00:25:03,760
I will.

352
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:05,080
Go with Aunt Hathaya.

353
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,360
I'll be back.

354
00:25:09,560 --> 00:25:11,640
Everything's okay. I'll take you to Mommy.

355
00:25:22,760 --> 00:25:23,680
Hello, Dad.

356
00:25:23,760 --> 00:25:24,840
Raiwin.

357
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,680
Ramil is bringing money to his mother.

358
00:25:28,280 --> 00:25:29,240
Come with me.

359
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:32,360
We'll deal with him the same way
we dealt with Anon.

360
00:25:33,600 --> 00:25:34,840
Kill him.

361
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,920
You're getting his money anyway.

362
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:41,360
Why do you need to kill him?

363
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:44,640
Twenty million is nothing. Understand?

364
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:46,320
If Ramil dies,

365
00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:50,120
all his property
and inheritance go to his mother.

366
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:52,360
And then they become mine.

367
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:56,920
Get over here. We're going together.

368
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,720
I have something I need to take care of.

369
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:02,480
Send me the location.
I'll follow you there.

370
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,880
Raiwin. Raiwin.

371
00:26:19,360 --> 00:26:21,360
MAX

372
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:23,720
Hello, Max. The furniture arrived?

373
00:26:24,400 --> 00:26:25,520
Ramil.

374
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:28,280
Have the workers
start furnishing the rooms.

375
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,640
Please answer me.

376
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:35,120
I'll be there soon.
I have to go. See you later.

377
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,120
Ramil.

378
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,080
Answer me, son.

379
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:41,440
So you heard everything.

380
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:44,040
You were going to warn your son?

381
00:26:44,120 --> 00:26:45,160
Fine.

382
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,480
Call him.

383
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:48,920
Call him and tell him you're on your way

384
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,040
to the meeting point.

385
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:52,480
Call him.

386
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:58,600
I said call him.

387
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:13,560
-Ramil.
-Mom.

388
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,000
I'm on my way.

389
00:27:15,760 --> 00:27:16,680
Is something wrong?

390
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:20,080
I'm on my way too. I'll see you there.

391
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:21,720
Okay.

392
00:27:24,760 --> 00:27:25,600
Ramil--

393
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:26,600
Hey.

394
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:28,400
Give me that. Do you want to die?

395
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:32,320
Please. Take as much money as you want.

396
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:35,000
Please don't hurt Ramil.

397
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,600
I'm begging you.

398
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:40,360
Ramil's life is worth far more than that.

399
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:41,760
I'm not letting him off.

400
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:45,880
You're coming with me.

401
00:27:47,080 --> 00:27:48,840
You're going to see your precious son.

402
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:51,080
I'll even let you say goodbye to him

403
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:53,560
and be the first one to hold his body.

404
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:56,240
Move!

405
00:29:16,160 --> 00:29:17,800
Why did you follow me?

406
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:20,120
I wanted to drive you home.

407
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:23,640
You wouldn't let me, so I followed you.

408
00:29:24,760 --> 00:29:26,560
You've seen that I made it home.

409
00:29:27,320 --> 00:29:29,600
Now get out of my house.

410
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:31,640
And never set foot here again.

411
00:29:34,280 --> 00:29:35,880
I said get out.

412
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:38,440
I don't want to see your face.

413
00:29:38,520 --> 00:29:39,960
Don't be so cold.

414
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,600
I came all this way.

415
00:29:43,280 --> 00:29:45,160
Let me see your face

416
00:29:45,840 --> 00:29:47,520
and your smile one last time.

417
00:29:48,120 --> 00:29:50,040
What do you want?

418
00:29:50,120 --> 00:29:52,280
If you don't leave,

419
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:54,200
I'm calling the police.

420
00:29:58,240 --> 00:30:00,880
I'll call someone to come collect
your body myself.

421
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:07,880
Hey! Stop!

422
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:10,320
Help! Help me!

423
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:13,960
Come here!

424
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,480
Why did you ask me to come here?

425
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:32,840
Were you ashamed

426
00:30:33,560 --> 00:30:35,600
someone would see you
taking money from me?

427
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:37,840
Whatever.

428
00:30:39,040 --> 00:30:40,400
Take it.

429
00:30:41,080 --> 00:30:42,640
Give it to your man.

430
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:44,960
After this, you and I are done.

431
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:46,720
Take it.

432
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:47,840
Take it.

433
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:51,640
Ramil. Run. Run!

434
00:30:57,440 --> 00:30:59,960
Ramil, run!

435
00:31:00,040 --> 00:31:01,520
I said move!

436
00:31:01,600 --> 00:31:04,000
Take the money. Just don't kill my son.

437
00:31:04,080 --> 00:31:06,280
No. No.

438
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:07,480
No. No.

439
00:31:08,080 --> 00:31:09,440
No.

440
00:31:09,520 --> 00:31:12,360
You have the money. Leave Ramil alone.

441
00:31:12,440 --> 00:31:15,000
I have to kill him. If I don't,

442
00:31:15,080 --> 00:31:16,640
he'll drag me straight to prison.

443
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:19,160
-Get out of the way right now.
-No. No.

444
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,280
-Get out of my way.
-No.

445
00:31:20,360 --> 00:31:21,760
Why won't you move?

446
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:28,400
Come here.

447
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:31,360
Stay still.

448
00:31:33,160 --> 00:31:34,520
I'm not going to kill you yet.

449
00:31:35,640 --> 00:31:37,000
Someone like you

450
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:40,000
is still very useful to me.

451
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:44,640
-Let me go!
-Quiet!

452
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:50,120
No one can save you.

453
00:31:51,600 --> 00:31:54,880
You tried to destroy my life
and my reputation.

454
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:57,000
You have to die.

455
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:01,320
-This is my house.
-Let's go see Mommy

456
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:25,960
-Mommy.
-Raiwin.

457
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:33,400
Daddy, please don't shoot Mommy.

458
00:32:35,280 --> 00:32:36,600
Raiwin.

459
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:40,600
You've already caused enough trouble.
Please don't commit another crime.

460
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:45,480
Daddy, please don't shoot Mommy.

461
00:32:47,080 --> 00:32:48,960
It's okay if you don't love me.

462
00:32:51,840 --> 00:32:54,360
But I only have one mommy.

463
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:24,200
Mommy.

464
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:27,400
It's okay now.

465
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:32,760
Are you hurt?

466
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,000
I'm okay.

467
00:33:35,800 --> 00:33:38,240
Thank you for coming.

468
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:43,880
There's something
I want you to help me with.

469
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:46,200
What do you need?

470
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:49,320
Call the police and have Raiwin arrested.

471
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,520
He needs to pay for what he did.

472
00:33:59,520 --> 00:34:00,480
Ramil.

473
00:34:01,800 --> 00:34:03,200
Where are you? Come out.

474
00:34:04,920 --> 00:34:07,920
If you want to see
your mother die that badly,

475
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,639
then stay hidden.

476
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:13,320
Move.

477
00:34:14,080 --> 00:34:16,040
I'll count to three.

478
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:18,560
If you don't come out,

479
00:34:18,639 --> 00:34:20,639
you can come collect your mother's body.

480
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,360
-Move.
-Ramil.

481
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:25,080
Run! Don't worry about me.

482
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:26,400
You.

483
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:28,880
Shut up!

484
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:29,800
One.

485
00:34:31,080 --> 00:34:33,840
I know you love me.

486
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:37,560
But you've spent your whole life
doing things for me.

487
00:34:39,560 --> 00:34:40,880
Two.

488
00:34:41,600 --> 00:34:43,719
I'm so proud of you, Ramil.

489
00:34:45,040 --> 00:34:48,639
Please let me do something
for you for once. Run, sweetheart.

490
00:34:48,719 --> 00:34:51,880
Enough. Three. Die!

491
00:34:51,960 --> 00:34:52,920
Don't!

492
00:34:58,200 --> 00:35:01,040
Ramil, don't do this.

493
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:03,680
You've already done so much for me.

494
00:35:05,160 --> 00:35:06,440
Mom.

495
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:12,080
I may not understand

496
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:15,040
why you did everything you did.

497
00:35:18,720 --> 00:35:20,040
But I love you.

498
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:26,160
I can't let him hurt you.

499
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:30,560
Your goodbyes are over.

500
00:35:34,160 --> 00:35:37,200
Ramil, someone like you

501
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:39,160
has always been nothing but a curse to me.

502
00:35:39,240 --> 00:35:41,000
You interfere with everything I do.

503
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:45,240
But this time,

504
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:48,960
I should thank you
for bringing me all this money.

505
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:52,040
Once you're dead,

506
00:35:52,720 --> 00:35:56,360
all your property and your inheritance
go to your mother.

507
00:35:57,720 --> 00:36:00,280
And after that,

508
00:36:01,280 --> 00:36:03,240
it all goes to me.

509
00:36:05,240 --> 00:36:08,280
I'll give you one last chance to speak

510
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:10,760
before I send you to hell.

511
00:36:17,160 --> 00:36:18,080
You used to

512
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:23,200
call me a parasite.

513
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:25,520
But today

514
00:36:27,200 --> 00:36:28,480
I've proved

515
00:36:30,480 --> 00:36:32,560
who the real parasites are.

516
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:37,600
You're corrupt politicians
who live off the people's tax money.

517
00:36:38,920 --> 00:36:41,240
And you tried to pass
your power down to your own son.

518
00:36:44,520 --> 00:36:45,640
But believe me.

519
00:36:47,040 --> 00:36:49,000
Parasites like you will never prosper.

520
00:36:49,720 --> 00:36:51,200
You'll only rot away

521
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:52,960
because you have no roots of your own.

522
00:36:53,040 --> 00:36:54,200
Ramil.

523
00:36:55,040 --> 00:36:56,480
And the last thing

524
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,920
I have to say to you is…

525
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:03,520
go to hell, you bastard.

526
00:37:03,600 --> 00:37:05,040
Ramil!

527
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:18,120
Bastard.

528
00:37:18,200 --> 00:37:19,520
Bastard.

529
00:37:28,160 --> 00:37:30,520
-Saksit!
-Ramil, don't.

530
00:37:31,400 --> 00:37:32,840
I don't want you to kill anyone.

531
00:37:42,680 --> 00:37:45,160
Mom. Are you okay?

532
00:37:46,200 --> 00:37:47,360
I'm okay.

533
00:37:58,120 --> 00:37:59,720
You killed her, right?

534
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:02,200
I couldn't.

535
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:05,440
I told you to kill her.

536
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:06,840
Get rid of the problem.

537
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:10,240
Hathaya and Papang came in.

538
00:38:10,320 --> 00:38:12,920
And Papang begged me not to shoot her.

539
00:38:14,200 --> 00:38:15,200
I couldn't do it.

540
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:17,000
Are you out of your mind?

541
00:38:17,080 --> 00:38:18,640
If you don't kill her,

542
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,280
she'll keep coming after you.

543
00:38:21,280 --> 00:38:22,680
Why did you come back here?

544
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:24,920
I tried to do this for you.

545
00:38:26,600 --> 00:38:27,840
You still have to help me.

546
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:29,680
You can't abandon me.

547
00:38:30,440 --> 00:38:33,000
The police are probably
looking for you already.

548
00:38:33,080 --> 00:38:34,760
You need to find somewhere to hide.

549
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:40,040
You have to help me.

550
00:38:40,800 --> 00:38:42,240
Don't abandon me.

551
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,520
Go.

552
00:38:46,800 --> 00:38:48,760
Before the police come
searching this place.

553
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:50,960
If you don't help me,

554
00:38:51,920 --> 00:38:53,120
I'll expose you.

555
00:38:54,240 --> 00:38:57,120
I'll tell everyone
you ordered me to kill Nuchwara.

556
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:25,320
How is your mother?

557
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:26,560
Oh.

558
00:39:26,640 --> 00:39:27,760
They treated her wounds.

559
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:29,440
She should be okay now.

560
00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:33,720
Aunt Sanguansri.

561
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:36,240
I hope you feel better soon.

562
00:39:36,880 --> 00:39:38,240
Thank you.

563
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:40,560
And thank you for everything
you've done for me.

564
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:44,200
Including keeping my secret.

565
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:46,840
Of course.

566
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,320
Hey.

567
00:39:50,200 --> 00:39:51,600
What secret?

568
00:39:55,600 --> 00:39:57,280
Aunt Sanguansri

569
00:39:58,080 --> 00:40:01,640
suspected Saksit was involved
in your father's death.

570
00:40:01,720 --> 00:40:04,640
That's why she decided
to stay at Saksit's house.

571
00:40:08,640 --> 00:40:10,320
Why didn't you tell me, Mom?

572
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:13,640
Because I know how hot-headed you can be.

573
00:40:14,200 --> 00:40:15,960
You might have done something reckless.

574
00:40:17,200 --> 00:40:21,200
I kept investigating.
Then I overheard him talking to Raiwin.

575
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:25,960
I tried to call and warn you,
but everything happened before I could.

576
00:40:34,680 --> 00:40:35,720
Mom.

577
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:37,800
I'm sorry.

578
00:40:39,240 --> 00:40:40,320
I misunderstood you

579
00:40:41,080 --> 00:40:43,080
this whole time.

580
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:47,400
No need to apologize.

581
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,800
You're a good son.

582
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:51,800
Everything you did was for me.

583
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:56,160
No matter what happens, I'm proud of you.

584
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:05,640
I love you, Mom.

585
00:41:08,200 --> 00:41:09,480
I love you too.

586
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:20,480
Damn it!

587
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:22,760
Everything is ruined!

588
00:41:23,840 --> 00:41:25,680
My old cases still aren't settled,

589
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:29,280
and now I have to run from another one?

590
00:41:31,160 --> 00:41:32,760
I warned you, Dad.

591
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:34,800
You never listened.

592
00:41:34,880 --> 00:41:37,560
This is your fault.

593
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:39,880
If you'd helped me,

594
00:41:40,440 --> 00:41:42,080
Ramil would be dead by now.

595
00:41:43,120 --> 00:41:43,960
Dad.

596
00:41:46,520 --> 00:41:48,000
We won't get away with this.

597
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:51,880
Let's turn ourselves in.

598
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:53,760
Hey.

599
00:41:54,280 --> 00:41:56,200
If we confess,

600
00:41:56,840 --> 00:41:58,120
the sentence could be reduced.

601
00:42:00,960 --> 00:42:02,720
If we hire a good lawyer,

602
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:06,080
we can still fight the case in court.

603
00:42:08,680 --> 00:42:09,920
Raiwin!

604
00:42:13,440 --> 00:42:16,240
You idiot.

605
00:42:17,160 --> 00:42:19,360
You know what I've done.

606
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:21,600
I killed someone.

607
00:42:22,880 --> 00:42:25,640
No lawyer is good enough to save me.

608
00:42:25,720 --> 00:42:26,760
Understand?

609
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:30,720
If you don't want to turn yourself in,
I won't stop you.

610
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:34,920
But I'm turning myself in.

611
00:42:41,440 --> 00:42:42,560
If you leave,

612
00:42:43,240 --> 00:42:44,400
you die.

613
00:42:45,160 --> 00:42:46,080
Raiwin.

614
00:42:54,640 --> 00:42:55,480
Dad.

615
00:42:57,840 --> 00:42:59,040
That's right.

616
00:43:00,560 --> 00:43:02,000
I'm your son.

617
00:43:03,400 --> 00:43:04,800
And if you abandon me,

618
00:43:06,480 --> 00:43:07,800
you die too.

619
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:12,280
What do you expect me to do?

620
00:43:13,840 --> 00:43:14,840
Now,

621
00:43:15,480 --> 00:43:16,840
the police are hunting us.

622
00:43:17,600 --> 00:43:19,120
There's no way out.

623
00:43:20,440 --> 00:43:21,480
No.

624
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:24,440
I'm going to survive somehow.

625
00:43:26,160 --> 00:43:27,040
Oh.

626
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:29,120
You know

627
00:43:29,200 --> 00:43:32,320
how this country works.
Money can buy anything.

628
00:43:33,040 --> 00:43:35,720
Can you find more money for me?

629
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:37,720
Then we'll leave Thailand.

630
00:43:38,480 --> 00:43:42,560
We'll stay away until the statute of
limitations expires. Then we'll come back.

631
00:43:52,600 --> 00:43:55,800
You gave him a gun
and ordered him to kill Nuchwara?

632
00:43:56,760 --> 00:43:58,920
You know how much I hate her.

633
00:43:59,000 --> 00:44:00,440
If Raiwin won't kill her,

634
00:44:00,520 --> 00:44:02,560
I'll kill her myself.

635
00:44:02,640 --> 00:44:05,640
And if…

636
00:44:05,720 --> 00:44:08,200
Raiwin gets arrested and exposes you?

637
00:44:08,280 --> 00:44:10,480
Then you'll be charged with
solicitation of murder.

638
00:44:10,560 --> 00:44:12,760
A coward like him

639
00:44:12,840 --> 00:44:14,880
has probably fled the country by now.

640
00:44:15,400 --> 00:44:16,320
Come on, Mom.

641
00:44:27,080 --> 00:44:29,640
Why did you come here? Why didn't you run?

642
00:44:29,720 --> 00:44:31,440
I need 50 million.

643
00:44:31,520 --> 00:44:33,040
I don't have that kind of money.

644
00:44:33,640 --> 00:44:34,560
Hey.

645
00:44:34,640 --> 00:44:37,240
My daughter has already given
you people more than enough.

646
00:44:37,320 --> 00:44:38,720
We have nothing left.

647
00:44:38,800 --> 00:44:40,800
Fifty million is cheap.

648
00:44:42,320 --> 00:44:44,040
It buys your freedom from a charge

649
00:44:44,720 --> 00:44:46,560
of ordering Nuchwara's murder.

650
00:44:47,200 --> 00:44:48,320
Don't.

651
00:44:49,440 --> 00:44:50,560
I don't have any left.

652
00:44:50,640 --> 00:44:52,440
Then use your grandfather's inheritance.

653
00:44:53,440 --> 00:44:55,520
There's more than enough
there to save your life.

654
00:44:57,600 --> 00:44:59,320
If you don't want to go to prison,

655
00:45:01,080 --> 00:45:02,400
get me the money.

656
00:45:06,960 --> 00:45:09,960
You're useless.
You can't do a single thing right.

657
00:45:10,040 --> 00:45:11,080
You're just a leech.

658
00:45:18,360 --> 00:45:20,080
Chayanee.

659
00:45:20,160 --> 00:45:23,400
I warned you again and again
not to get involved with those people.

660
00:45:23,480 --> 00:45:24,960
They're worse than fleas.

661
00:45:25,040 --> 00:45:26,880
Mom, stop complaining

662
00:45:26,960 --> 00:45:29,160
and help me figure out
where we can get the money.

663
00:45:30,280 --> 00:45:32,480
It's hard to take money
from the office now.

664
00:45:32,560 --> 00:45:35,600
Hathaya is helping oversee the accounts.

665
00:45:35,680 --> 00:45:37,320
If she catches us,

666
00:45:37,400 --> 00:45:40,680
she'll definitely come after us.
That damned woman.

667
00:45:40,760 --> 00:45:42,880
Then we need to get rid of her

668
00:45:43,560 --> 00:45:45,320
and use Grandpa's inheritance.

669
00:45:45,400 --> 00:45:47,400
We don't even know what's in the will.

670
00:45:47,480 --> 00:45:49,040
How are we supposed to use it?

671
00:45:49,800 --> 00:45:51,840
You're close to Grandpa's lawyer.

672
00:45:52,360 --> 00:45:55,560
And don't forget money can buy anything.

673
00:45:59,080 --> 00:46:02,000
Then I'll pay the lawyer

674
00:46:02,760 --> 00:46:05,160
to tell us what's in Grandpa's will.

675
00:46:10,640 --> 00:46:13,280
What does Grandpa's will say?

676
00:46:14,400 --> 00:46:17,640
He left that house to Hathaya.

677
00:46:19,800 --> 00:46:24,000
It's only one house.
I could buy a hundred of them.

678
00:46:24,080 --> 00:46:26,640
Grandpa left all the money,

679
00:46:27,440 --> 00:46:30,840
property, and real estate to me.

680
00:46:34,440 --> 00:46:35,760
No, sweetheart.

681
00:46:36,440 --> 00:46:39,800
Grandpa left everything to Hathaya.

682
00:46:42,520 --> 00:46:44,400
Then what about us?

683
00:46:47,320 --> 00:46:51,120
He only left 10 million
each to you and me.

684
00:46:54,280 --> 00:46:57,400
Grandpa is playing favorites.
He can't do this.

685
00:46:58,000 --> 00:47:00,040
He's probably angry

686
00:47:00,120 --> 00:47:02,680
about us embezzling money
and causing all these problems.

687
00:47:04,160 --> 00:47:05,800
If we can't get money for Raiwin,

688
00:47:06,520 --> 00:47:09,120
they'll send me to prison.

689
00:47:09,200 --> 00:47:10,880
Mom.

690
00:47:10,960 --> 00:47:12,480
Call the lawyer back.

691
00:47:12,560 --> 00:47:15,600
Pay him to create a fake will.

692
00:47:15,680 --> 00:47:18,000
And what if Grandpa recovers

693
00:47:18,080 --> 00:47:20,680
and can speak again? Everyone will know

694
00:47:20,760 --> 00:47:22,440
the will is fake.

695
00:47:23,560 --> 00:47:26,320
Dead people can't talk.

696
00:47:28,280 --> 00:47:29,160
Chayanee.

697
00:47:31,080 --> 00:47:32,560
You're planning to kill Grandpa?

698
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:35,760
I don't have a choice, Mom.

699
00:47:37,480 --> 00:47:38,920
It's the only way

700
00:47:39,680 --> 00:47:41,320
I survive.

701
00:47:41,400 --> 00:47:43,240
No…

702
00:47:49,080 --> 00:47:50,040
Chayanee.

703
00:47:51,600 --> 00:47:52,920
Grandpa.

704
00:47:54,760 --> 00:47:57,520
I brought you some of
the roses Grandma planted.

705
00:47:58,920 --> 00:48:00,320
Don't they smell wonderful?

706
00:48:10,920 --> 00:48:12,200
Grandpa.

707
00:48:12,760 --> 00:48:15,320
Ramil's development is almost finished.

708
00:48:15,920 --> 00:48:19,040
I want you to be the guest of honor
when we open the new homes.

709
00:48:21,360 --> 00:48:24,040
He looks much brighter, Miss Hathaya.

710
00:48:25,040 --> 00:48:27,840
It's just a shame he still can't move

711
00:48:27,920 --> 00:48:29,600
or speak.

712
00:48:30,200 --> 00:48:31,880
It won't be long, Aunt Ann.

713
00:48:32,880 --> 00:48:35,000
Grandpa is in good spirits.

714
00:48:35,080 --> 00:48:37,120
His body will improve too.

715
00:48:38,840 --> 00:48:40,920
Is the herbal medicine ready?

716
00:48:41,000 --> 00:48:42,240
Yes.

717
00:48:42,760 --> 00:48:44,880
Then I'll pour some for him.

718
00:48:45,920 --> 00:48:47,440
Wait for me, Grandpa.

719
00:48:47,960 --> 00:48:49,480
Get some rest.

720
00:49:18,000 --> 00:49:19,200
Chayanee.

721
00:49:33,520 --> 00:49:37,080
I just want to help you sleep well.

722
00:49:37,160 --> 00:49:39,240
Please save Mr. Pichai.

723
00:49:39,320 --> 00:49:41,840
Grandpa. Grandpa, wake up.

724
00:49:41,920 --> 00:49:44,880
NEXT EPISODE

725
00:49:45,840 --> 00:49:47,080
-Blood…
-Enough, Dad.

726
00:51:42,640 --> 00:51:44,880
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
